    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Web_Enhancements\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Web Enhancements\">Star Wars Saga Edition Web Enhancements</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews\" title=\"Star Wars Miniatures Previews\">Star Wars Miniatures Previews</a>)</i></p><p>A miniaturized self-destruct system functions as a normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Self-Destruct_System\" title=\"Self-Destruct System\">Self-Destruct System</a>, but it functions as if the droid were two sizes larger. This costs 5 times as much as a normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Self-Destruct_System\" title=\"Self-Destruct System\">Self-Destruct System</a>.</p><table class=\"wikitable\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <th>DROID SIZE</th>\n   <th>DAMAGE</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Diminutive</td>\n   <td>4d6</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Tiny</td>\n   <td>6d6</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Small</td>\n   <td>8d6</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Medium</td>\n   <td>10d6</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Large or Larger</td>\n   <td>20d6</td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
